{
  "id": "2CH.11",
  "number": "11",
  "bookId": "2CH",
  "reference": "2 Int 11",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 23,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "11",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2CH 11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "11",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Enaibon e Shemaia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake pee elotu Rehoboam Yerusalem, neiturrur enkaji e Yuda o ene Benchamen, iltung'ana nkalifuni iip o ntomoni isiet gelunot, pee earare Israel, pee errinyoki Rehoboam enkitoria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake eewuo ororei lo Laitoriani enetii Shemaia ilo tung'ani le Nkai, ejo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Tiaaki Rehoboam olayioni le Solomon, olaiguanani le Yuda, o Siraeli pooki ootii Yuda, o Benchamen, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nji ejo Olaitoriani, Mipuopuo intae aarare ilalashera linyi. Torrinyoyu pooki tung'ani shomo enkang enye, amu ore ena bae naa nanu eing'uaa.” Neaku etoning'o ninche ororei lo Laitoriani, nerrinyo neitu epuo aarare Yeroboam.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Etesheta Rehoboam nkanas naata isunta",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etobiko apa Rehoboam te Yerusalem neshet nkanas naamitunye kewan tiatua Yuda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "etesheta Betlehem, o Etam, o Tekoa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o Betsur, o Soko, o Adulam, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o Gat, o Maresha, o Sif, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o Adoraim, o Lakish, o Ashetak, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o Sora, o Ahijalon, o Hebron, nkanas naasheta isunta naatii Yuda o Benchamen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitagol ninye isempewueti, nepik ilarikok le njore atua ninche, nepik ineeshumieki endaa o eilata o enaisho oo sabibu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nepik sii iremeta o long'oi atua nena anas pooki, neitagol ninche oleng. Neaku eeta apa ninye Yuda o Benchamen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eetuo ilapolosak o Lawi Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ilapolosak o Lawi apa ootii atua Israel pooki, neing'uaa ninye too wuejitin pooki apa neetii ninche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu etung'uaitie Ilawi iwuejitin enye, o ntokitin enye nepuonu Yuda o Yerusalem enkaraki nataarayie Yeroboam ninche o layiok lenyena aaitung'uaa enkisiaayiare anaa lapolosak lo Laitoriani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.12.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Ilai 12.31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "negelu ilapolosak lenyena loo wuejitin neeika, o too wuejitin neeseremieki nkitanyaanyukot, o Nkaitin oo lasho naaitobira ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore lelo ootipika iltauja lenye pee eing'oru Olaitoriani Enkai e Israel nepuonu aasuju ninche eing'uaa iloshon pooki loo Siraeli o meetu Yerusalem, aapolosaki Olaitoriani Enkai oo loo menye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitagol ninche enkitoria e Yuda, ore too larin okuni neitaserian ninche Rehoboam olayioni le Solomon, amu eshomo ninche too larin okuni aaibung orrekie le Daudi o Solomon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Olmarei le Rehoboam",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eewa apa Rehoboam aitaa enkitok enye Mahalat entito e Yerimot olayioni le Daudi, apa ole Abigail entito e Eliab olayioni le Yese. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neiki ninye ilayiok, Yeush, o Shemaria, o Saham. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore tesiadi ina neitoki aya Maaka entito e Absalom, naa ninye natoikio ninye Abija, o Atai, o Sisa, o Shelomit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyor apa Rehoboam Maaka ina tito e Absalom aitalang nena kituaak enyena pooki, o nkapiak. (Eyama apa ninye nkituaak tomon o isiet o nkapiak ntomoni ile neeta ilayiok tikitam o isiet, o ntoyie ntomoni ile.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Negelu Rehoboam Abija ilo ayioni le Maaka metaa ninye olkitok tiatua ilalashera lenyena, amu kejo apa pee eitaa ninye olaiguanani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neas ninye ine ng'eno, neidapashaki kulikae ayiok lenyena aibulunye enkop e Yuda o Benchamen, eeta ndaiki kumok, neing'uraki ninche nkituaak.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
